#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Guidance on key team roles, building skills, and technical best practices."
msgstr ""
"Panduan tentang peran tim utama, membangun keterampilan, dan praktik terbaik"
" teknis."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble your team"
msgstr "Rakit tim"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble your team {#assemble-your-team}"
msgstr "Rakit tim {#assemble-your-team}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Assembling a quantum team will likely be challenging, given the shortage of "
"people with experience in quantum computing. But are there strategies that "
"make it easier? Are some roles even more critical in early stages, and are "
"there best practices that can ensure the right people are on the team and "
"know their roles? Successful leaders of quantum projects say \"yes\". The "
"guidelines below have proven useful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Merakit tim kuantum kemungkinan akan menjadi tantangan, mengingat kurangnya "
"orang yang berpengalaman dalam komputasi kuantum. Tapi apakah ada strategi "
"yang membuatnya lebih mudah? Apakah beberapa peran bahkan lebih kritis di "
"tahap awal, dan apakah ada praktik terbaik yang dapat memastikan orang yang "
"tepat berada di tim dan mengetahui peran mereka? Pemimpin sukses proyek "
"kuantum mengatakan \"ya\". Panduan-panduan di bawah ini telah terbukti "
"berguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Key points**\n"
msgstr "**Poin kunci**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Establish and develop a quantum team: Build applied quantum expertise by "
"hiring and upskilling. \n"
msgstr ""
"Bangun dan kembangkan tim kuantum: Bangun keahlian kuantum terapan dengan "
"merekrut dan meningkatkan keterampilan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Identify team objectives and mission to drive success and alignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi tujuan dan misi tim untuk mendorong kesuksesan dan "
"keselarasan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build partnerships that can help you meet your expertise needs. Identify "
"potential partners and members early. Develop the plan with your partners.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bangun kemitraan yang dapat membantu kamu memenuhi kebutuhan keahlianmu. "
"Identifikasi calon mitra dan anggota sejak dini. Kembangkan rencana bersama "
"mitramu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that everyone knows their role in the larger endeavors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan semua orang mengetahui peran mereka dalam upaya yang lebih besar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Establish a internal quantum champion to advocate for quantum computing and "
"keep the organization current on advancements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan penggerak (champion) kuantum internal untuk mengadvokasi komputasi "
"kuantum dan membuat organisasi tetap terkini tentang perkembangan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is worth reiterating that for any client-facing quantum initiative (such "
"as a QIC, startup, or quantum consulting group), it is a good idea to reach "
"out to potential members/clients early on. This is especially important "
"given the novel nature of quantum computing and the burgeoning quantum "
"industry, since new membership agreements can take a long time to "
"finalize.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu ditekankan kembali bahwa untuk setiap inisiatif kuantum yang menghadap"
" klien (seperti QIC, startup, atau grup konsultasi kuantum), ada baiknya "
"untuk menjangkau calon anggota/klien sejak dini. Ini terutama penting "
"mengingat sifat baru komputasi kuantum dan industri kuantum yang sedang "
"berkembang, karena perjanjian keanggotaan baru dapat membutuhkan waktu lama "
"untuk diselesaikan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build and onboard a new quantum team {#build-and-onboard-a-new-quantum-team}"
msgstr ""
"Bangun dan integrasikan tim kuantum baru {#build-and-onboard-a-new-quantum-"
"team}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In some cases, launching a quantum project will mean hiring team personnel, "
"and in other cases, you may already have internal expertise. The key thing "
"is to identify the roles that must be filled. It is also important to have "
"some idea of what full-time equivalent (FTE) is required for various roles, "
"especially when some key players are splitting their time between "
"projects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam beberapa kasus, meluncurkan proyek kuantum berarti merekrut personel "
"tim, dan dalam kasus lain, kamu mungkin sudah memiliki keahlian internal. "
"Hal utamanya adalah mengidentifikasi peran yang harus diisi. Penting juga "
"untuk memiliki gambaran tentang apa full-time equivalent (FTE) yang "
"diperlukan untuk berbagai peran, terutama ketika beberapa pemain kunci "
"membagi waktu mereka antara proyek-proyek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This might differ according to organization and goals, but there are some "
"very safe bets. Find your organization type below to see what roles have "
"been critical to success in the past, and recommendations of **minimum** "
"FTEs devoted to various roles. Some partnerships may require more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini mungkin berbeda menurut organisasi dan tujuan, tapi ada beberapa taruhan"
" yang sangat aman. Temukan jenis organisasimu di bawah untuk melihat peran "
"apa yang telah kritis untuk kesuksesan di masa lalu, dan rekomendasi FTE "
"**minimum** yang didedikasikan untuk berbagai peran. Beberapa kemitraan "
"mungkin memerlukan lebih banyak.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Academic institution, research organization, or QIC {#academic-institution-"
"research-organization-or-qic}"
msgstr ""
"Institusi akademis, organisasi penelitian, atau QIC {#academic-institution-"
"research-organization-or-qic}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following are critical roles:\n"
msgstr "Peran-peran berikut adalah yang kritis:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Domain or application subject matter experts (SMEs):** These are technical"
" experts who develop code, demonstrate the current state of quantum "
"computing, build demos and prototypes, and identify early applications. It "
"is advised to have experts in both quantum computing and in the application "
"area.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pakar materi pokok (SME) domain atau aplikasi:** Ini adalah pakar teknis "
"yang mengembangkan kode, mendemonstrasikan keadaan komputasi kuantum saat "
"ini, membangun demo dan prototipe, dan mengidentifikasi aplikasi awal. "
"Disarankan untuk memiliki pakar baik dalam komputasi kuantum maupun di area "
"aplikasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Project manager/team lead and support:** These may cover a wide variety of"
" support and management topics, including onboarding new members, supporting"
" scientists with their work, delivering value to customers, and working on "
"strategic initiatives. Other specialized activities include "
"licensing/contract support, workflow, and compliance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Manajer proyek/pemimpin tim dan pendukung:** Ini mungkin mencakup berbagai"
" topik dukungan dan manajemen, termasuk mengintegrasikan (onboarding) "
"anggota baru, mendukung ilmuwan dengan pekerjaan mereka, memberikan nilai "
"kepada pelanggan, dan mengerjakan inisiatif strategis. Aktivitas khusus "
"lainnya termasuk dukungan lisensi/kontrak, alur kerja, dan kepatuhan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Program manager:** A leadership role focused on technical implementation. "
"This person manages technical aspects of internal and external projects, "
"identifies potential research collaborations, and identifies application and"
" research priorities. Other activities include managing research funds and "
"grants, spearheading outreach, and generally supporting core research "
"functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Manajer program:** Peran kepemimpinan yang berfokus pada implementasi "
"teknis. Orang ini mengelola aspek teknis proyek internal dan eksternal, "
"mengidentifikasi potensi kolaborasi penelitian, dan mengidentifikasi "
"prioritas aplikasi dan penelitian. Aktivitas lainnya termasuk mengelola dana"
" penelitian dan hibah, memimpin penjangkauan, dan umumnya mendukung fungsi "
"penelitian inti.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Administrator:** A 'hub admin' is responsible for adding and removing new "
"members to the provider, assigning groups and projects, and tracking usage "
"for the organization. For more information on how administrators can create "
"and track user accounts, visit the [documentation](/guides/cloud-account-"
"structure).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Administrator:** 'Admin hub' bertanggung jawab untuk menambahkan dan "
"menghapus anggota baru ke provider, menetapkan grup dan proyek, serta "
"melacak penggunaan untuk organisasi. Untuk info lebih lanjut tentang "
"bagaimana administrator dapat membuat dan melacak akun pengguna, kunjungi "
"[dokumentasinya](/guides/cloud-account-structure).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended **minimum** FTEs:\n"
msgstr "FTE **minimum** yang disarankan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| At year zero (just starting up)               |    Recommended minimum FTE       |\n"
"| -------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Subject matter expert      | 1.0-1.5 FTE       |\n"
"| Project manager            | 1.5 FTE           |\n"
"| Program manager            | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Administrator              | 1.0 FTE |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pada tahun nol (baru memulai)               |    FTE minimum yang disarankan       |\n"
"| -------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Pakar materi pokok      | 1.0-1.5 FTE       |\n"
"| Manajer proyek            | 1.5 FTE           |\n"
"| Manajer program            | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Administrator              | 1.0 FTE |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Enterprise organization {#enterprise-organization}"
msgstr "Organisasi enterprise {#enterprise-organization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Executive sponsor/advocate:** An advocate for quantum computing (QC) "
"within the leadership of the broader organization. This person has a vision "
"of how QC will revolutionize their field, and keeps abreast of latest "
"developments, but also manages expectations by accurately describing the "
"capabilities and constraints of modern quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Sponsor/advokat eksekutif:** Seorang advokat untuk komputasi kuantum (KK) "
"dalam kepemimpinan organisasi yang lebih luas. Orang ini memiliki visi "
"tentang bagaimana KK akan merevolusi bidang mereka, dan selalu mengikuti "
"perkembangan terbaru, tapi juga mengelola ekspektasi dengan menggambarkan "
"secara akurat kapabilitas dan batasan komputer kuantum modern.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Technical team (domain or application subject matter experts):** These are"
" technical experts who develop code, demonstrate the current state of "
"quantum computing, build demos and prototypes, and identify early "
"applications. It is advised to have experts in both quantum computing and in"
" the application area.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tim teknis (pakar materi pokok domain atau aplikasi):** Ini adalah pakar "
"teknis yang mengembangkan kode, mendemonstrasikan keadaan komputasi kuantum "
"saat ini, membangun demo dan prototipe, dan mengidentifikasi aplikasi awal. "
"Disarankan untuk memiliki pakar baik dalam komputasi kuantum maupun di area "
"aplikasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Project manager/team lead and support:** A leadership role focused on "
"technical implementation. This person manages technical aspects of internal "
"and external projects, identifies potential research collaborations, and "
"identifies application and research priorities. Other activities include "
"managing research funds and grants, spearheading outreach, and generally "
"supporting core research functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Manajer proyek/pemimpin tim dan pendukung:** Peran kepemimpinan yang "
"berfokus pada implementasi teknis. Orang ini mengelola aspek teknis proyek "
"internal dan eksternal, mengidentifikasi potensi kolaborasi penelitian, dan "
"mengidentifikasi prioritas aplikasi dan penelitian. Aktivitas lainnya "
"termasuk mengelola dana penelitian dan hibah, memimpin penjangkauan, dan "
"umumnya mendukung fungsi penelitian inti.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Business SME:** Team member(s) who explore partnership opportunities, "
"develop the local quantum ecosystem, and who identify potential application "
"areas and funding opportunities.\n"
msgstr ""
"**SME bisnis:** Anggota tim yang menjelajahi peluang kemitraan, "
"mengembangkan ekosistem kuantum lokal, dan mengidentifikasi area aplikasi "
"potensial dan peluang pendanaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| At year zero (just starting up)       |      Recommended minimum FTE         |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Executive sponsor          | 0.25 FTE      |\n"
"| Project manager            | 1.0 FTE         |\n"
"| Subject matter expert      | 2.0 FTE         |\n"
"| Business SME               | 1.0 FTE        |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pada tahun nol (baru memulai)       |      FTE minimum yang disarankan         |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Sponsor eksekutif          | 0.25 FTE      |\n"
"| Manajer proyek            | 1.0 FTE         |\n"
"| Pakar materi pokok      | 2.0 FTE         |\n"
"| SME bisnis               | 1.0 FTE        |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Startups {#startups}"
msgstr "Startup {#startups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Startups have a wide variety of structures. Subject matter expertise and "
"technical leadership will always be important. Here we also assume that "
"business development is a priority.\n"
msgstr ""
"Startup memiliki berbagai struktur. Keahlian materi pokok dan kepemimpinan "
"teknis akan selalu penting. Di sini kita juga mengasumsikan bahwa "
"pengembangan bisnis adalah prioritas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Business SME:** Team member(s) who explore partnership opportunities, "
"develop the local quantum ecosystem, and identify potential application "
"areas and funding opportunities.\n"
msgstr ""
"**SME bisnis:** Anggota tim yang menjelajahi peluang kemitraan, "
"mengembangkan ekosistem kuantum lokal, dan mengidentifikasi area aplikasi "
"potensial dan peluang pendanaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| At year zero (just starting up)       |      Recommended minimum FTE         |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Project manager            | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Subject matter expert      | 2.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Business SME               | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pada tahun nol (baru memulai)       |      FTE minimum yang disarankan         |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Manajer proyek            | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Pakar materi pokok      | 2.0 FTE           |\n"
"| SME bisnis               | 1.0 FTE           |\n"

